  "claim_limits": [
    "Intermediate Patch IVV with fresh Debian 13 and AlmaLinux 10.2 AMD64 native execution. Full Upgrade IVVQ remains a separate track.",
    "APK has verified native signatures, reproducible construction and payload checks, without fresh Alpine native execution in this campaign.",
    "The installed v4.10.3 updater uses the explicit authenticated unpublished candidate bundle. AlmaLinux also executes the official v4.10.2 to current signed RPM upgrade.",
    "Four Debian removal paths are independent observations. RPM has no separate purge command; standalone removal, standard native erase and the optional profile are checked separately.",
    "Explicitly retained administrator configuration and private inactive recovery archives are distinguished from active product state.",
    "The VPN probe uses narrow temporary administrator forwarding rules, verifies encrypted round trips and observed directional packet counters, and restores the original default-drop chain.",
    "Kernel performance uses 48000 paired UDP request-response samples on one virtual host under the same CPU quota. It does not establish CPU affinity, physical NIC wire rate, HA endurance or every network topology.",
    "Original harness and transport failures remain private with their original bytes. Reviewed independent observations resolve their exact scope without erasing failed attempts.",
    "Final baselines are restored. Debian requires reapplying only two original append-only history attributes. AlmaLinux requires policy-based SELinux relabeling; provider-generated timestamps and IPv4 DNS changes are bounded and all other policy files remain exact.",
    "Previous accepted evidence retains its original product identity and supplies selective source-reviewed continuity only. No historical native verdict is transferred.",
    "Observed feed success does not guarantee future external provider availability."
  ]
